      "node_id": "kg_doc_5",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Title: Ken St. Andre. Kenneth Eugene St. Andre (born on April 28, 1947 in Ogden, Utah) is an American fantasy author and game designer, best known for his work with \"Tunnels & Trolls\" and \"Wasteland\". He has been an active member of \"The Science Fiction and Fantasy Writers of America\" since 1989.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
